    <p style="color:#FFFFFF"> 3). Once you are at the deicated page of the match you want to see, scroll down and you will find around 70+ working links for that game. (remember, links thread is opened 1 hour before the kickoff).</p>
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF"> 4). The match page has so many links but the system is simple. The best streamers and their links are listed higher. So that ensure users get to best links as soon as possible. Streamers names are listed next to their links which ensure user can keep track of their favourite streams. Channel names and lanaguage are also listed in the link box to make sure best experience</p>
            
                <p style="color:#FFFFFF"> 5). You can also visit previous day matches and the upcoming matches by clicking on buttons above streaming options.</p>


